  "usage": "When a user asks 'show me all rat experiments', map 'rat' → taxid 10116 → 'Rattus norvegicus' before generating the SQL: WHERE subject.species ILIKE 'Rattus norvegicus' OR subject.metadata->>'species_taxid' = '10116'."
